    <redactioneleBlokken>
      <Value Culture="nl-nl"><![CDATA[{
  "layout": {
    "Umbraco.BlockList": [
      {
        "contentUdi": "umb://element/3f85724cb32544e0b52be8a87ab54fb1"
      },
      {
        "contentUdi": "umb://element/e0b9ae4a939748e6b2ef1c37f334a070"
      },
      {
        "contentUdi": "umb://element/0e0c603176394b8a82e5a2b40b3183ae"
      },
      {
        "contentUdi": "umb://element/43d82939be154f03a9c55b3b40a73c3b"
      },
      {
        "contentUdi": "umb://element/75fd87df100145da8db0e36966c8c19f"
      },
      {
        "contentUdi": "umb://element/a0ca4e355a794533956ed702538d3893"
      },
      {
        "contentUdi": "umb://element/7689b636ddb0425584e45b227081f907"
      }
    ]
  },
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "b82f5cb4-6576-4045-8b07-87cb704ecc95",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>Heeft u na het lezen van deze informatie nog vragen? Stel uw vraag aan de Gipskamer via <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.mijnolvg.nl/\">MijnOLVG</a> of per e-mail. Op werkdagen kunt u ook bellen.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/3f85724cb32544e0b52be8a87ab54fb1"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "d9e78940-efcf-406f-9dfd-85b46f62ed51",
      "editorialContent": "umb://document/c83f7df12f1848ae9a6134b2add87108",
      "udi": "umb://element/e0b9ae4a939748e6b2ef1c37f334a070"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "d9e78940-efcf-406f-9dfd-85b46f62ed51",
      "editorialContent": "umb://document/979e0b4d8c414361a97dff95407952ee",
      "udi": "umb://element/0e0c603176394b8a82e5a2b40b3183ae"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "b82f5cb4-6576-4045-8b07-87cb704ecc95",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>Als de Gipskamer niet bereikbaar is, belt u met klachten die echt niet kunnen wachten naar de Spoedeisende Hulp via het algemene telefoonnummer van OLVG.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/43d82939be154f03a9c55b3b40a73c3b"
    },
    {
